<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: Thank you, my dear ally, as always.

We are finally ready to strike the reclamation force site. They may come back, but we believe this time we can hurt them badly.

Here is the plan: we will harass and raid them without pause to buy you time; you must become an ice pick and drive straight into the heart of their headquarters to destroy their contact computer. Cut off from headquarters, they will lose their footing on this world! -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.desc>谢谢你，我亲爱的盟友，一直以来都是。\n\n我们终于做足了准备去袭击回收部队的据点，他们或许会卷土重来。但是我们相信，这次一定可以给他们重创。\n\n行动计划如下：我们会持续不停地骚扰和袭击他们，为你们争取时间；而你们，必须化作一个冰锥，直刺他们总部的心脏，捣毁他们的联络电脑。这样，他们就会和总部断开联系，我们在这个星球就可以站稳脚跟了！</MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.desc>
  <!-- EN: Final operation -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.label>终局行动</MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.label>
  <!-- EN: Accept the final operation and head to the reclamation force headquarters to destroy the contact computer. -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.options.0.desc>接受终局行动，前往回收部队总部摧毁联络电脑。</MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.options.0.desc>
  <!-- EN: Yes - it is time to settle accounts with them -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.options.0.label>是-是时候清算他们了</MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.options.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Decide later and close the window. You can contact the Mincho Alliance again when ready. -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.options.1.desc>暂时不做决定，关闭窗口。准备好后可以重新联络珉巧同盟。</MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.options.1.desc>
  <!-- EN: Later - wait! We are not ready yet! -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.options.1.label>待定-等等！我们还没准备好！</MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.options.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Qinxintang -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.title>沁心糖</MCW_Event_QuestF1_AllianceContact.title>
  <!-- EN: Thank you! My ally! We have finally beaten them, and I think my mission is complete. We paid a great price, but it was worth it!

We are free of them at last and can hand out ice cream across this world as much as we like! I think I should visit you first. May I? -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.desc>谢谢你！我的盟友！我们终于击败了他们，我认为我的使命已经完成了。虽然我们付出了巨大的牺牲，但是这是值得的！\n\n我们终于摆脱了他们，可以在这个世界尽情地发放冰淇淋了！我认为我需要先拜访下你们，可以吗？</MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.desc>
  <!-- EN: Thanks -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.label>感谢</MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.label>
  <!-- EN: Qinxintang will come to your colony. -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.options.0.desc>沁心糖会来到你的殖民地。</MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.options.0.desc>
  <!-- EN: Yes - welcome! I have wanted you to visit for a long time! -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.options.0.label>是-欢迎！！我早就希望你能来看看了！</MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.options.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Decide later and close the window. You can contact the Mincho Alliance again afterwards. -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.options.1.desc>暂时不做决定，关闭窗口。之后可以重新联络珉巧同盟。</MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.options.1.desc>
  <!-- EN: Later - wait! Let me tidy the room first! -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.options.1.label>待定-等等！我去收拾下房间！</MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.options.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Qinxintang -->
  <MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.title>沁心糖</MCW_Event_QuestFF1_AllianceContact.title>

</LanguageData>
